### Health
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Detect caller type + route
POST http://localhost:3000/api/handle
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: change-me-to-a-long-random-string

{ "text": "I just got out last week and I have nowhere to stay" }

### General question
POST http://localhost:3000/api/receptionist
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "What are your office hours?" }

### Full intake
POST http://localhost:3000/api/intake
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "caller": { "fullName": "Marcus Lee", "phone": "+12025550123", "email": "marcus@example.com", "docNumber": "DC123456", "preferredContact": "phone", "language": "en" },
  "assessment": { "housing": 0, "employment": 1, "support": 1, "emotional": 2, "spiritual": 2 }
}

### Schedule appointment (demo: Tre's calendar)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/appointment
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Marcus Lee", "email": "marcus@example.com", "phone": "+12025550123", "purpose": "Intake appointment", "startISO": "2026-06-02T14:00:00-04:00", "endISO": "2026-06-02T14:30:00-04:00" }

### Volunteer sign-up
POST http://localhost:3000/api/volunteer
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Jane Doe", "email": "jane@example.com", "roleId": "mentor", "availability": "Saturday mornings" }

### Donor / partner
POST http://localhost:3000/api/donor
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Acme Church", "email": "give@acme.org", "partner": true, "requestMeeting": true }

### Take message / crisis alert
POST http://localhost:3000/api/message
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Caller", "phone": "+12025550123", "message": "Caller in distress, needs follow-up", "priority": "crisis" }

### Single webhook for the AI agent
POST http://localhost:3000/api/webhook/claude
Content-Type: application/json

{ "action": "intake", "payload": { "caller": { "fullName": "Test Caller" }, "assessment": { "housing": 1 } } }
